<view class="gp-page">
  <view class="gp-card">
    <view class="gp-section-title">模型平台</view>
    <view class="gp-chips">
      <view
        wx:for="{{providers}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="gp-chip {{item.id === providerId ? 'gp-chip-on' : ''}}"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bindtap="onPickProvider"
      >{{item.name}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="gp-muted">都走 OpenAI 兼容接口。选好预设后只需填 API Key；模型名可改成平台当前提供的型号。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="gp-card">
    <view class="field">
      <view class="gp-section-title">接口地址（Base URL）</view>
      <input
        class="gp-input"
        value="{{baseUrl}}"
        maxlength="-1"
        placeholder="https://api.example.com/v1"
        placeholder-class="gp-placeholder"
        bindinput="onBaseUrl"
      />
      <view class="gp-muted hint">会请求 {接口地址}/chat/completions，必须是 https。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="gp-row-between">
        <view class="gp-section-title">API Key</view>
        <view class="gp-link toggle" hover-class="gp-pressed" bindtap="onToggleKey">{{showKey ? '隐藏' : '显示'}}</view>
      </view>
      <input
        class="gp-input"
        value="{{apiKey}}"
        password="{{!showKey}}"
        maxlength="-1"
        placeholder="sk-..."
        placeholder-class="gp-placeholder"
        bindinput="onApiKey"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <view class="gp-section-title">模型名称</view>
      <input
        class="gp-input"
        value="{{model}}"
        maxlength="-1"
        placeholder="例如 deepseek-v4-flash"
        placeholder-class="gp-placeholder"
        bindinput="onModel"
      />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{testMessage}}" class="{{testOk ? 'test-ok' : 'gp-error'}}">
    <text class="gp-text">{{testMessage}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="gp-actions">
    <view class="gp-btn {{testing ? 'gp-btn-disabled' : ''}}" hover-class="gp-pressed" bindtap="onTest">{{testing ? '测试中…' : '测试连接'}}</view>
    <view class="gp-btn gp-btn-primary" hover-class="gp-pressed" bindtap="onSave">保存</view>
  </view>

  <view class="gp-card notes">
    <view class="gp-section-title">使用须知</view>
    <view class="note">API Key 只保存在这台手机的小程序本地存储里，不会上传到我们的服务器，但也没有加密。请使用单独创建、可随时作废的 Key，并在平台设置用量上限。</view>
    <view class="note">小程序只能访问后台配置过的「request 合法域名」。如果提示域名不在合法域名里，需要小程序管理员在后台添加对应平台的域名。</view>
  </view>
</view>
